---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { AUTHOR } from '../consts';
---
<Base title="About">
  <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>Hi, I'm {AUTHOR}. By day I work on business systems, and the rest of the time I think about life, work, and the ideas that sit underneath them.</p>
    <p>This blog is where I write those thoughts down. Some posts are about work, some about spirit and meaning, and some are just about noticing things.</p>
    <p>Edit this page in <code>src/pages/about.astro</code> to tell readers about yourself.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
